<?xml version="1.0"?>
<body language="English">
	<row id="msg_0647_00000" index="0">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Blue</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0647_00001" index="1">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Wha... I can’t make out what you\nsayin’! This connection is trash!\rCall from somewhere better, OK?</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0647_00002" index="2">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Wassup...\nWhatever... Don’t worry about me.\fI’m doin’ peachy over here!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0647_00003" index="3">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">There any Block Bosses you ain’t\nscrapped yet?\fMake your move! Show some initiative!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0647_00004" index="4">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">If it ain’t Sunday night, I ain’t\navailable. Call then or forget it!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0647_00005" index="5">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I was just lookin’ for somethin’\nto do!\fWanna scrap me again? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0647_00006" index="6">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Whatever!\nI ain’t losin’ to you again, got that?\rI’ll be waitin’ at the Saffron Dojo.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0647_00007" index="7">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Whatever. Sound like you pretty\nbusy yourself.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0647_00008" index="8">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Wha...?\nOh, c’mon... Ain’t you made plans\fwith enough other people?</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0647_00009" index="9">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I’m waitin’ at the Saffron Dojo.\fC’mon, show a lil initiative!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0647_00010" index="10">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I’m Blue.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0647_00011" index="11">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Remember we made plans to scrap at\nthe Saffron Dojo?\fWha...! You FORGOT?\fC’mon, I ain’t got all day!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0647_00012" index="12">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">When I look at homies, I get a weird\nfeelin’--you ever get that?\rThere’s round ones, square ones,\nflyin’ ones, swimmin’ ones,\fflamin’ ones, freezin’ ones,\nshiny ones, dark ones--\fthere’s SO many types, and\fyet, they all homies.\rI mean, like homies, there ain’t\njust one type of person either...\rBut it’s still kinda weird when you\nthink about it.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0647_00013" index="13">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Anyway, you somethin’ else.\rTravelin’ all by yourself, hittin’ all\nthese different Blocks and\fbeatin’ ’em all...\rWell, you ain’t deadass alone...\nYou got homies with you!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0647_00014" index="14">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Man, this guy called Red took\nme out in a heartbeat.\rI ain’t seen him in a minute...\nI wonder where he at and what he\fup to...\rCome to think of it, you look a lil\nlike Red. Yeah, you do.\rJust...\nJust a lil bit. Whatever...</language>
	</row>
</body>
